  "description": "VooDoo Loco Mountain Bike\n\nThe Voodoo Loco, is a true British, steel, hardcore hardtail. Built with MX (mixed) wheelset with a 29\" front wheel and smaller 27.5\" rear wheel, this bike offers the perfect balance between agility and stability. The smaller rear wheel keeps the chainstays short, delivering a playful ride and snappy acceleration while the larger front wheel keeps the front end stable, allowing it to roll smoothly.\n\nThe frame is made from chromoly steel, known for its strength, resilience, and ability to take the sting out of rough terrain and harsh drops while allowing a bit of flex to aid traction. Whether it's conquering climbs, darting down descents or if you're just going loco down in Acapulco, the Voodoo Loco is designed to push limits, inspire confidence and deliver an exhilarating ride.\n\nVoodoo Loco, a steel hardcore hardtail that expertly blends agility and stability for an exhilarating ride on any terrain.",
